('12-PHY-RO-0001','TS-Inter-2,MPC,JEE','Physics','Ray Optics','Reflection','Easy',0,NULL,'Angle of incidence equals angle of reflection is','Law of reflection','Snell''s law','Brewster''s law','Malus law','A','First law of reflection.',NULL,1,NOW()),
